[2025-09-23 19:42:55,245][Thread 14][INFO] - source chunk:
ple where saliency detection does not work in general .The cell example shows the good potential of FSS - 1 0 0 0 in instance segmentation which significantly contributes to cell counting in medical image analysis where , for instance , a patient 's health directly correlates to his or her red blood cell count .With the advance of whole slide images ( WSI ) in which the width and height often exceed 1 0 0 , 0 0 0 pixels ( and thus many cells to count ) , using our few - shot segmentation trained on FSS - 1 0 0 0 , pathologists only need to label 5 image relevant regions and then the rest of the WSI will be automatically labeled .Similarly , the related animal examples of sheep , penguin and wild goose show FSS - 1 0 0 0 's potential for large - scale instance segmentation .Few - shot learning/segmentation is an emerging attractive alternative , where prediction is made given only a few training examples
